{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-parity-violation-skein","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:parity-violation-skein","kind":"proposition","title":"Parity non-conservation from the Skein relation at $q \\neq 1$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-beta-decay-skein","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-reidemeister-action-table"],"tags":["parity","weak-force","skein-relation","lee-yang","wu-experiment","mirror","crossing-chirality","symmetry-breaking"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.parity_violation_skein","text":"parity-violation-skein.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/parity-violation-skein.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:parity-violation-skein\"></a><p>Parity is violated by the weak interaction if and only if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\neq 1</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Proposition.</strong>\n<em>The Skein relation is invariant under parity <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{P}: L_+ \\leftrightarrow L_-</code> if and only if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = 1</code>. For any <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\neq 1</code>, the weak interaction violates parity.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/parity-violation-skein.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"15.12.10"}
